This is the OFFICIAL download guide of ARCH-MOBILE.

You currently need a moto g84 5g / bangkk
You preferebly need a laptop but can use a phone as no app is needed currently, can change.

Turn on Oem and usb debugging in deveoper.
According to my vision you don't need stock firmware, my progress has just started so not sure.

Download adb and fastboot tools.
Boot your phone to bootloader power and volume down.

Check if you can communicate to the device by fastboot device.

